        Info: {
          OfficialDownload: "Official Download",
          ProductIntroduction: "Product Introduction",
          SupportMultipleLanguagesAndYouCanAlsoTranslateLanguageFilesAndCreateNewLanguageSupportByYourself: "Support multiple languages, and you can also translate language files and create new language support by yourself",
          InfoText: "Material Design Forum is a web forum application that uses Vuetify 2 as its preferred theme UI. It supports responsive design to adapt to different device screen sizes, defining three device types: PC, Pad, and Mobile. You can witness these remarkable changes when resizing your browser window. The user functionality section supports operations such as topics, questions, articles, answers, comments, and replies. The management functions include publishing, editing, and deleting topics, questions, articles, answers, comments, and replies. Additionally, the management panel offers dashboard data previews, data management deletion, site data settings, and email settings for notifications. Furthermore, it introduces user group functionalities.The overall interface style combines Material Design with a Ground Glass aesthetic, providing users with an elegant and comfortable experience. We will always love Material Design.",
          WhenClickingOnTheLinkBelowTheCorrespondingExtractionCodeWillBeAutomaticallyCopiedToYourClipboardPastingBoard: "When clicking on the link below, the corresponding extraction code will be automatically copied to your clipboard (pasting board)",
          DownloadProductsFromTheFollowingDifferentChannelsAsWellAsTheHelpFolderForProductUsage: "Download products from the following different channels, as well as the help folder for product usage",
          OneTwoThreeCloudDisk: "123 Cloud Disk",
          LanZouYunDisk: "LanZouYun Cloud Disk",
          AliYunDisk: "AliYun Cloud Disk",
          BaiduYunDisk: "BaiduYun Cloud Disk",
          Github: "Github",
          QQGroup: "QQ Group",
          InfoText1: "Material Design Forum is a web-based forum application dedicated to providing users with an outstanding interactive experience and visual enjoyment. The application uses the advanced Vuetify 2 framework as the preferred theme for UI design, while also introducing the new client-side theme MDUI 2.0, ensuring that the interface adheres to modern aesthetic trends while maintaining the core design principles of Material Design. To cater to diverse device usage scenarios, the forum has been specially designed with a responsive layout that can intelligently detect and adapt to three different device types: PC, tablet (Pad), and mobile devices (Mobile). Users can experience the flexible changes in the layout of the interface by simply resizing their browser window. This seamless switching not only enhances the user experience but also demonstrates the forward-thinking nature of the technology.In terms of functionality, Material Design Forum builds a comprehensive community interaction ecosystem. Ordinary users can freely initiate topics, ask questions, publish articles, write answers, participate in comments, and reply, fully meeting the needs of knowledge sharing and communication. For administrators, the platform provides comprehensive content management tools, including but not limited to publishing, editing, and deleting topics, questions, articles, answers, comments, and replies, ensuring the standardization and quality of community content. Furthermore, the admin panel integrates powerful backend features, such as real-time data dashboard previews, which help administrators quickly grasp the forum's operational status. Data management and deletion functions ensure the effectiveness and security of the data, while site data settings and email settings further enhance the forum's customization capabilities and operational flexibility. Notably, the forum introduces user group functionality, allowing for detailed permission allocation, enabling diversified user role management and offering more possibilities for community governance.The overall interface style of Material Design Forum strictly follows the Material Design guidelines, with every detail meticulously crafted, from color matching and icon design to animation transitions, aiming to provide users with an elegant, comfortable, and layered visual experience. Whether in dark mode or light mode, the forum offers the best reading and usage environment in various scenarios. Additionally, the forum supports multiple languages, offering several commonly used language options and an open translation interface for language files, allowing users to create or modify language packs according to their needs, greatly expanding the forum's international application range. This multilingual support not only reflects the forum's inclusivity but also builds a bridge for seamless communication among global users.In conclusion, Material Design Forum, with its exquisite design, powerful features, and flexible customization options, has become a modern forum platform that combines aesthetics and practicality. Whether you are a dedicated fan of Material Design, an administrator seeking efficient community management tools, or a global user eager for cross-language communication, you will find value and enjoyment here. Let us all love and support Material Design, working together to create a better online community environment.",
        },
